{"seq":2,"slug":"precision-agriculture","title":"精准农业前沿","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture","introMarkdown":"# 精准农业前沿 简介\n\n精准农业（Precision Agriculture）通过遥感监测、智能装备和数据驱动决策，将农业管理从\"一刀切\"的粗放模式转向\"按需供给\"的精细化模式。这一领域融合了遥感科学、人工智能、物联网工程和作物科学，正在重塑从播种到收获的全产业链。\n\n本知识库聚焦精准农业博士研究的三个前沿方向，帮助研究者掌握从数据获取到智慧决策的完整技术栈。\n\n**第一章 遥感与人工智能** 系统介绍卫星和无人机多光谱成像的数据获取原理、深度学习在作物表型自动化提取中的应用，以及高光谱与激光雷达数据融合的前沿方法。\n\n**第二章 智慧农场** 聚焦田间执行层面的技术系统，涵盖变量施用技术（VRT）的处方图生成与控制逻辑、物联网传感器网络与边缘计算架构，以及农业自主机器人的导航与任务规划。\n\n**第三章 气候适应性** 探讨精准农业技术在应对气候变化中的角色，包括作物模型与决策支持系统的耦合、农业生态系统数字孪生的构建方法，以及气候智慧型农业战略的系统性框架。\n\n建议学习路径：先从遥感与 AI 建立数据感知能力，再深入智慧农场理解执行层技术，最后通过气候适应性掌握系统级决策方法论。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"remote-sensing-ai","title":"遥感与人工智能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/remote-sensing-ai","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"satellite-uav-multispectral","title":"博士精准农业 — 卫星与无人机多光谱成像","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/remote-sensing-ai/satellite-uav-multispectral"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deep-learning-crop-phenotyping","title":"博士精准农业 — 深度学习与作物表型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/remote-sensing-ai/deep-learning-crop-phenotyping"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hyperspectral-lidar-fusion","title":"博士精准农业 — 高光谱与激光雷达融合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/remote-sensing-ai/hyperspectral-lidar-fusion"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"smart-farming","title":"智慧农场","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/smart-farming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"variable-rate-technology","title":"博士精准农业 — 变量施用技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/smart-farming/variable-rate-technology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"iot-sensor-edge-computing","title":"博士精准农业 — 物联网传感器网络与边缘计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/smart-farming/iot-sensor-edge-computing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"autonomous-agricultural-robots","title":"博士精准农业 — 农业自主机器人","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/smart-farming/autonomous-agricultural-robots"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"climate-adaptation","title":"气候适应性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/climate-adaptation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crop-modeling-dss","title":"博士精准农业 — 作物模型与决策支持系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/climate-adaptation/crop-modeling-dss"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-twin-agroecosystems","title":"博士精准农业 — 农业生态系统数字孪生","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/climate-adaptation/digital-twin-agroecosystems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"climate-smart-agriculture","title":"博士精准农业 — 气候智慧型农业战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/precision-agriculture/climate-adaptation/climate-smart-agriculture"}]}]}